Upstream version: 1.12.1
Local modifications: Apply patches/blender.diff
* Added a NANOFLANN_PARALLEL_INVOKE hook so the tree can be built with Blender's TBB task pool
  instead of the std::async threads nanoflann creates itself, which ignore the thread count
  Blender is run with. Subtrees below NANOFLANN_PARALLEL_GRAIN_SIZE points are built inline.
  See divideTreeParallel(), allocateNode() and buildIndex() (marked with "BLENDER:").
